  <main id="main" class="sandwich-page">
    <section class="sandwich-hero"><div class="container-page sandwich-hero-grid"><div class="sandwich-hero-copy"><nav class="compressor-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="products.html">Products</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Sandwich Panels</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">Insulation Systems</span><h1>Sandwich panels that build dependable temperature-controlled spaces.</h1><p>Specify high-performance insulated panels for cold rooms, freezer rooms, chiller rooms, food-storage facilities and industrial building envelopes.</p><div class="compressor-hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Request a Quote <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#panel-options">Explore Panel Options</a></div><div class="compressor-quickfacts"><span><i data-lucide="thermometer-snowflake"></i>Cold-room insulation</span><span><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>Durable building envelopes</span><span><i data-lucide="ruler"></i>Project-specific sizing</span></div></div><div class="sandwich-hero-image"><img src="assets/images/sandwich-panels/pu-panel.jpg" alt="PU insulated sandwich panel"><div><span>Insulated enclosure systems</span><b>Panel systems for controlled environments</b></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-intro section-pad"><div class="container-page compressor-intro-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Built Around Thermal Performance</span><h2>The panel core defines the enclosure’s performance.</h2></div><p>Sandwich panels combine protective exterior skins with an insulating core. The right material depends on the thermal target, fire requirements, acoustic needs, moisture exposure and intended application.</p></div></section>
    <section id="panel-options" class="sandwich-options section-pad"><div class="container-page"><div class="compressor-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Panel Core Options</span><h2>Choose insulation that suits the application.</h2></div><p>Our selection supports both temperature-controlled facilities and wider commercial or industrial enclosure needs.</p></div><div class="sandwich-card-grid"><article class="sandwich-card"><div class="sandwich-card-image"><img src="assets/images/sandwich-panels/pu-panel.jpg" alt="PU sandwich panel"></div><div class="sandwich-card-copy"><span>POLYURETHANE</span><h3>PU panels for cold rooms and freezers</h3><p>Polyurethane panels offer strong thermal-insulation performance, durable coated skins and secure tongue-and-groove assembly for temperature-controlled rooms.</p><ul><li>Suitable for cold rooms, chiller rooms and freezer rooms</li><li>Applicable to walls, roofs, floors, facades and ceilings</li></ul></div></article><article class="sandwich-card"><div class="sandwich-card-image"><img src="assets/images/sandwich-panels/cold-room-envelope.png" alt="Insulated cold room envelope"></div><div class="sandwich-card-copy"><span>EXPANDED POLYSTYRENE</span><h3>EPS lightweight closed-cell insulation</h3><p>EPS is a rigid, lightweight closed-cell insulation material with low water absorption and multiple strength options for construction and insulated-panel use.</p><ul><li>Closed-cell structure supports moisture resistance</li><li>Available across strengths for different loading conditions</li></ul></div></article><article class="sandwich-card"><div class="sandwich-card-image"><img src="assets/images/sandwich-panels/cold-room-envelope.png" alt="Industrial insulation panel installation"></div><div class="sandwich-card-copy"><span>ROCK WOOL</span><h3>Fire-resistant stone-wool insulation</h3><p>Rock Wool is a mineral-fiber insulation based on basalt rock and recycled slag, selected where thermal protection, sound absorption and non-combustibility matter.</p><ul><li>Suitable for commercial and industrial insulation</li><li>Can perform at elevated temperatures depending on density</li></ul></div></article><article class="sandwich-card"><div class="sandwich-card-image"><img src="assets/images/sandwich-panels/cold-room-envelope.png" alt="Thermal insulation building envelope"></div><div class="sandwich-card-copy"><span>GLASS WOOL</span><h3>Flexible thermal and acoustic insulation</h3><p>Glass wool traps air within intertwined glass fibers to support thermal insulation and sound control across panels, ducts, pipes and building assemblies.</p><ul><li>Available in rolls, slabs and application-specific forms</li><li>Useful for thermal insulation and soundproofing needs</li></ul></div></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="sandwich-selection"><div class="container-page condenser-selection-grid"><div class="condenser-selection-visual"><img src="assets/images/sandwich-panels/cold-room-envelope.png" alt="Cold room insulated panel system"><div><i data-lucide="layers-3"></i><span>Every panel choice supports the whole enclosure</span></div></div><div class="compressor-selection-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Engineering-Led Selection</span><h2>Plan the envelope around the temperatures inside it.</h2><p>Our team helps assess the room temperature, wall and roof configuration, moisture exposure, fire and acoustic requirements, panel thickness, door interfaces and installation needs before specifying the system.</p><div class="selection-list"><div><i data-lucide="thermometer-snowflake"></i><span>Target temperature and thermal-performance needs</span></div><div><i data-lucide="shield"></i><span>Fire, moisture and durability requirements</span></div><div><i data-lucide="layout-panel-top"></i><span>Wall, roof, floor and door-panel coordination</span></div></div><a class="text-link-dark" href="contact.html">Speak with an engineer <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-cta"><div class="container-page compressor-cta-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Plan Your Enclosure</span><h2>Need insulated panels designed for a cold room or critical space?</h2><p>Share your application and our team will help define the appropriate panel system.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Talk to Thermo-Care <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i></a></div></section>
